dsh-plugin-boot-whale-maid — LICENSE
====================================

TWO SEPARATE LICENCES, APPLIED TO TWO SEPARATE THINGS.
The software licence below covers the plug-in's CODE. It does NOT cover the
artwork, and it cannot: the artwork is third-party work that this package
merely references by URL. Read both sections before redistributing anything.


